  "zipball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/scaleway/scaleway-cli/zipball/v2.65.2",
  "body": "## What's Changed\r\n* chore(core): migrate iot, info, init, iam to go-vcr.v4 by @elwinar in https://github.com/scaleway/scaleway-cli/pull/6381\r\n* feat(mongodb): migrate CLI namespace from v1alpha1 to stable v1 API by @jremy42 in https://github.com/scaleway/scaleway-cli/pull/6298\r\n* chore(core): migrate the lb, mcp and mnq namespaces to go-vcr.v4 by @elwinar in https://github.com/scaleway/scaleway-cli/pull/6386\r\n* chore(deps): bump github.com/moby/buildkit from 0.33.0 to 0.33.1 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/scaleway/scaleway-cli/pull/6384\r\n* chore(deps): bump github.com/aws/aws-sdk-go-v2/service/s3 from 1.113.4 to 1.114.0 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/scaleway/scaleway-cli/pull/6385\r\n* fix(search): rename resource type datalab by @scaleway-bot in https://github.com/scaleway/scaleway-cli/pull/6371\r\n* fix(rdb): improve engine autocompletion by @remyleone in https://github.com/scaleway/scaleway-cli/pull/6390\r\n* feat: add support for default version for redis create and autocomplete by @remyleone in https://github.com/scaleway/scaleway-cli/pull/6383\r\n* fix(alias): fix panic with empty aliases by @remyleone in https://github.com/scaleway/scaleway-cli/pull/6392\r\n* chore(deps): bump github.com/moby/moby/client from 0.6.0 to 0.6.1 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/scaleway/scaleway-cli/pull/6394\r\n* chore: avoid using internal as a file name by @remyleone in https://github.com/scaleway/scaleway-cli/pull/6396\r\n* feat(devcontainers): mise trust and install on start, read-only mount configuration by @elwinar in https://github.com/scaleway/scaleway-cli/pull/6399\r\n* chore(core): migrate redis, registry, secret, test and webhosting to go-vcr-.v4 by @elwinar in https://github.com/scaleway/scaleway-cli/pull/6389\r\n* chore(account): remove deprecated code on ValidateAuthenticationCodeSignUpResponse message by @scaleway-bot in https://github.com/scaleway/scaleway-cli/pull/6388\r\n* feat(mongodb): add project_id when listing node types by @scaleway-bot in https://github.com/scaleway/scaleway-cli/pull/6398\r\n* docs(mongodb): add descriptions to the EndpointSpec public_network and private_network fields by @scaleway-bot in https://github.com/scaleway/scaleway-cli/pull/6397\r\n* feat(key_manager): update ImportKeyMaterial to accept encrypted payload by @scaleway-bot in https://github.com/scaleway/scaleway-cli/pull/6401\r\n* feat(secret_manager): add support for generating secret name by @scaleway-bot in https://github.com/scaleway/scaleway-cli/pull/6403\r\n* feat(baremetal): add network boot feature by @scaleway-bot in https://github.com/scaleway/scaleway-cli/pull/6416\r\n* feat(baremetal): add network boot feature by @scaleway-bot in https://github.com/scaleway/scaleway-cli/pull/6423\r\n* chore(deps): bump golang.org/x/sync from 0.23.0 to 0.24.0 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/scaleway/scaleway-cli/pull/6427\r\n* feat: update generated APIs by @scaleway-bot in https://github.com/scaleway/scaleway-cli/pull/6430\r\n* feat(audit_trail): add resource type instance_dedicated_pool by @scaleway-bot in https://github.com/scaleway/scaleway-cli/pull/6432\r\n* feat(cockpit): add alloy config snippet generation for metrics, logs and traces by @jremy42 in https://github.com/scaleway/scaleway-cli/pull/5638\r\n* feat(block): add it-mil-1, it-mil-2 and it-mil-3 zones by @scaleway-bot in https://github.com/scaleway/scaleway-cli/pull/6433\r\n* feat: add support for plugin by @remyleone in https://github.com/scaleway/scaleway-cli/pull/6422\r\n* build(deps): pin node v24 to avoid the ARC x Node v25+ situationship by @elwinar in https://github.com/scaleway/scaleway-cli/pull/6446\r\n* fix(core): escape pipes in generated argument tables by @WynandVStaden in https://github.com/scaleway/scaleway-cli/pull/6359\r\n* chore(deps): bump github.com/mattn/go-colorable from 0.1.15 to 0.1.16 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/scaleway/scaleway-cli/pull/6443\r\n* ci(nightly): allow manually running the nightly workflow by @elwinar in https://github.com/scaleway/scaleway-cli/pull/6449\r\n* chore(deps): bump github.com/moby/buildkit from 0.33.1 to 0.34.0 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/scaleway/scaleway-cli/pull/6448\r\n* tests: recover panic in Check func to allow AfterFunc to run anyway by @Mia-Cross in https://github.com/scaleway/scaleway-cli/pull/6455\r\n* ci(actions): factorize the checkout and mise actions by @elwinar in https://github.com/scaleway/scaleway-cli/pull/6451\r\n* feat(multiple_namespaces): add SRN integration by @scaleway-bot in https://github.com/scaleway/scaleway-cli/pull/6435\r\n* docs(domain): add missing field descriptions for registrar API by @scaleway-bot in https://github.com/scaleway/scaleway-cli/pull/6456\r\n* fix(vpc): don't try to setup a mongodb instance in the vpc tests to avoid oos issues by @elwinar in https://github.com/scaleway/scaleway-cli/pull/6454\r\n* ci(cache): improve the ci cache keys fallback and freshness by @elwinar in https://github.com/scaleway/scaleway-cli/pull/6458\r\n* feat(core): add global -H/--no-headers flag to skip headers in human output by @kucharskim in https://github.com/scaleway/scaleway-cli/pull/6414\r\n* chore(deps): bump github.com/getsentry/sentry-go from 0.49.0 to 0.50.0 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/scaleway/scaleway-cli/pull/6467\r\n* feat(domain): add ListContactsRequest filters and OrderBy enum by @scaleway-bot in https://github.com/scaleway/scaleway-cli/pull/6459\r\n* chore(deps): bump github.com/aws/aws-sdk-go-v2 from 1.47.1 to 1.47.2 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/scaleway/scaleway-cli/pull/6468\r\n* chore(deps): bump github.com/moby/moby/client from 0.6.1 to 0.6.2 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/scaleway/scaleway-cli/pull/6469\r\n* feat(ipam): add serverless_job resource type to IP list filters by @scaleway-bot in https://github.com/scaleway/scaleway-cli/pull/6464\r\n* chore(deps): bump github.com/aws/smithy-go from 1.28.2 to 1.28.4 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/scaleway/scaleway-cli/pull/6444\r\n* build(docker): guard docker's latest and stable tags against pre-rele… by @elwinar in https://github.com/scaleway/scaleway-cli/pull/6472\r\n* chore(deps): bump github.com/aws/aws-sdk-go-v2/service/s3 from 1.114.0 to 1.114.1 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/scaleway/scaleway-cli/pull/6442\r\n* fix(instance): fix CLI verb for ListServerCompatibleTypes by @scaleway-bot in https://github.com/scaleway/scaleway-cli/pull/6474\r\n* chore(deps): bump github.com/aws/aws-sdk-go-v2 from 1.47.2 to 1.47.3 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/scaleway/scaleway-cli/pull/6481\r\n* chore(deps): bump golang.org/x/crypto from 0.57.0 to 0.58.0 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/scaleway/scaleway-cli/pull/6479\r\n* chore(deps): bump github.com/aws/smithy-go from 1.28.4 to 1.28.5 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/scaleway/scaleway-cli/pull/6480\r\n* test(instance): cover security-group create output format by @ousamabenyounes in https://github.com/scaleway/scaleway-cli/pull/6477\r\n* chore(deps): bump github.com/aws/aws-sdk-go-v2/service/s3 from 1.114.1 to 1.114.3 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/scaleway/scaleway-cli/pull/6483\r\n* chore: add support for a mise run:cli by @remyleone in https://github.com/scaleway/scaleway-cli/pull/6476\r\n* docs(domain): fix inaccurate and incomplete field descriptions by @scaleway-bot in https://github.com/scaleway/scaleway-cli/pull/6475\r\n* ci(release): move the artifact publication into its own workflow by @elwinar in https://github.com/scaleway/scaleway-cli/pull/6485\r\n* feat(k8s): add support for connect using k9s by @remyleone in https://github.com/scaleway/scaleway-cli/pull/6375\r\n* chore: bump dependencies by @remyleone in https://github.com/scaleway/scaleway-cli/pull/6489\r\n* fix(instance): re-record the create server test cassettes after stricter wait semantics by @elwinar in https://github.com/scaleway/scaleway-cli/pull/6499\r\n* chore: add a check to ensure go mod tidy by @remyleone in https://github.com/scaleway/scaleway-cli/pull/6502\r\n* ci(cache): avoid go-build cache accumulation by not restoring on main by @elwinar in https://github.com/scaleway/scaleway-cli/pull/6506\r\n* chore: convert cassette format to v2 by @remyleone in https://github.com/scaleway/scaleway-cli/pull/6509\r\n* fix(vcr): ensure vcrs don't have single quote in their names by @elwinar in https://github.com/scaleway/scaleway-cli/pull/6510\r\n* chore(deps): bump github.com/moby/buildkit from 0.34.0 to 0.34.1 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/scaleway/scaleway-cli/pull/6514\r\n* ci(release): add a default value to the DISABLE_RELEASE in goreleaser's configuration by @elwinar in https://github.com/scaleway/scaleway-cli/pull/6519\r\n* feat(iam): handle the rules.deny field in policy endpoints by @scaleway-bot in https://github.com/scaleway/scaleway-cli/pull/6503\r\n\r\n## New Contributors\r\n* @WynandVStaden made their first contribution in https://github.com/scaleway/scaleway-cli/pull/6359\r\n* @kucharskim made their first contribution in https://github.com/scaleway/scaleway-cli/pull/6414\r\n* @ousamabenyounes made their first contribution in https://github.com/scaleway/scaleway-cli/pull/6477\r\n\r\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/scaleway/scaleway-cli/compare/v2.65.1...v2.65.2",
